Package: enigma2-plugin-extensions-bootlogoswitcher
Version: 1.0
Architecture: all
Section: extra
Priority: optional
Maintainer: @stein17
Homepage: https://github.com/ (optional)
Description: Bootlogo and Radiologo Switcher by @stein17 for Enigma2.
 This plugin allows easy switching between bootlogo.mvi and radio.mvi.
 Supported image formats: JPG, PNG, MVI. Non-MVI images are automatically
 converted using ffmpeg (if installed). Includes preview, mode switching,
 automatic resolution scaling, and optional restart prompt.

